Atlas Bank Tech Stack
Backend
✅ Node.js
✅ Express.js
Database
✅ MongoDB Community Edition
✅ Mongoose
Authentication
✅ bcrypt
✅ jsonwebtoken (JWT)
Validation
✅ Zod (meri recommendation) ya Express Validator

Main Zod recommend karunga. Ye modern, TypeScript-friendly aur industry me bahut popular ho raha hai.

Security
✅ Helmet
✅ CORS
✅ express-rate-limit
✅ express-mongo-sanitize
✅ hpp (HTTP Parameter Pollution protection)
✅ cookie-parser
✅ compression
Environment
✅ dotenv
Logging
✅ Morgan (development)
✅ Winston + Daily Rotate File (production logs)
Email
✅ Nodemailer
Gmail SMTP (development)
Baad me apna SMTP ya free email provider use kar sakte hain.
File Upload
✅ Multer
Image Processing
✅ Sharp
Password Reset
✅ crypto (Node.js built-in)
Scheduling
✅ node-cron
Testing
✅ Postman
Baad me Jest + Supertest
Documentation
✅ Swagger (OpenAPI)
Deployment
✅ Docker
✅ Docker Compose
Baad me Nginx

